WEBVTT

00:01.770 --> 00:04.430
We finally meet again, Spica.

00:04.930 --> 00:06.770
Master Claude...

00:06.770 --> 00:10.400
I've been waiting for this: 
the day of our reunion.

00:10.760 --> 00:14.060
Without further ado... I have a request.

00:15.180 --> 00:17.190
I need you to help me...

00:19.680 --> 00:21.910
by kissing my butt!

00:27.220 --> 00:28.410
What a nightmare!

00:29.290 --> 00:31.010
Get up already!

00:31.410 --> 00:33.820
I'm sorry, Asster— I mean, Master!

00:33.820 --> 00:35.630
Did you just call me Ass?!

00:34.980 --> 00:40.540
I can't believe I had that 
dream! I'm so embarrassed!

00:35.630 --> 00:41.010
It's Claude Sirius, not Siriass! 
 Got that?! Hey! You hear me?!

02:11.620 --> 02:14.060
All right, let's begin 
your magic training.

02:14.370 --> 02:15.750
Okay!

02:15.750 --> 02:20.280
Now, do you know what's most 
important about using magic, Spica?

02:20.280 --> 02:21.740
Let's see...

02:21.740 --> 02:24.360
A willingness to dream, I guess?

02:25.760 --> 02:27.920
Wow, I hate that face.

02:28.560 --> 02:31.240
It's nothing that abstract.

02:31.240 --> 02:32.790
It's your magic affinity.

02:32.790 --> 02:34.370
My magic affinity?

02:34.770 --> 02:37.020
The type of magic that you're born with.

02:37.020 --> 02:40.370
It's hard to acquire any magic that 
isn't of the type you're attributed to.

02:41.730 --> 02:43.320
Without an affinity for flying magic,

02:43.320 --> 02:46.560
you're never going to get 
off the ground on your own.

02:46.560 --> 02:50.040
So the reason I can't use flying magic...

02:50.040 --> 02:54.070
Flying magic is attributed 
to Sagittarius and Aries.

02:54.070 --> 02:57.890
Master, I'm a Virgo! 
What type does that make me?

02:57.890 --> 02:59.030
Relax.

02:59.750 --> 03:03.230
Your type is determined by 
the twelve zodiac constellations.

03:03.830 --> 03:08.620
Virgo is associated with Demeter, 
the goddess of fertility.

03:08.620 --> 03:10.420
So, plant magic.

03:11.110 --> 03:15.220
You can create vegetation 
anywhere and everywhere,

03:15.220 --> 03:17.340
making them produce fruit and grain.

03:17.340 --> 03:19.450
What? That's awesome!

03:19.450 --> 03:20.920
Oh, hang on...

03:20.920 --> 03:25.840
Does Virgo have that Rebirth Magic 
the Book of Providence talked about?

03:26.130 --> 03:27.240
No.

03:27.240 --> 03:29.560
No such magic exists for any attribute.

03:30.460 --> 03:32.310
It's that special?

03:32.540 --> 03:33.440
Yeah.

03:33.440 --> 03:36.140
So then, if I work on refining it...

03:36.140 --> 03:37.470
Nope.

03:37.470 --> 03:39.800
Forget about that for a while.

03:40.250 --> 03:42.870
And don't tell anyone 
you have that ability.

03:42.870 --> 03:43.910
Got it?

03:44.620 --> 03:47.350
Now, let's work on Virgo magic.

03:47.350 --> 03:49.490
Try making this seedling grow.

03:49.490 --> 03:50.570
Use your wand.

03:50.570 --> 03:51.480
Okay.

03:51.920 --> 03:55.380
Wands work by focusing the magic 
in your body on a single point.

03:55.850 --> 03:59.310
The chant is the switch 
to activate your magic.

03:59.600 --> 04:02.520
Finally, you need to imagine 
the seedling growing.

04:03.220 --> 04:06.580
The more vivid your mental picture, 
the stronger the magic.

04:06.580 --> 04:07.780
Try it.

04:07.780 --> 04:10.220
For the damsel, the graces of the stars.

04:10.220 --> 04:13.700
For the seedling, the blessings 
of the goddess of the earth.

04:14.790 --> 04:16.000
Imagine it...

04:16.610 --> 04:17.910
Imagine it...

04:19.490 --> 04:22.040
Virgo Magic: Anima!

04:24.740 --> 04:26.390
I did it...

04:27.030 --> 04:30.680
I did it, Master!

04:30.680 --> 04:31.750
I can see that.

04:31.750 --> 04:33.460
Why aren't you excited?

04:33.460 --> 04:36.080
Activating magic is only 
the very first step.

04:36.080 --> 04:39.200
Like riding a bike with training wheels.

04:39.200 --> 04:41.830
You can't be satisfied with just that.

04:41.830 --> 04:47.320
I need to make you a first-class magician 
so you can undo my curse permanently!

04:48.460 --> 04:50.370
He's so heartless.

04:50.370 --> 04:53.350
That was the first time I ever used magic.

04:53.350 --> 04:56.100
He could give me a little more praise.

04:56.640 --> 04:58.350
You're strong.

04:59.680 --> 05:00.720
No!

05:00.720 --> 05:02.820
That's what I get for having a hero!

05:02.820 --> 05:04.390
Wake up, Spica!

05:04.390 --> 05:05.720
Goodbye, my first love!

05:05.720 --> 05:07.970
I will dedicate my life 
to the study of magic!

05:07.970 --> 05:10.120
Hey, did you stop the magic?

05:10.390 --> 05:11.480
Stop...?

05:14.970 --> 05:17.120
You aren't controlling it properly.

05:17.120 --> 05:18.030
Do it again.

05:18.030 --> 05:21.160
Help me first!

05:22.450 --> 05:25.630
After a day of training, 
I've now realized...

05:26.220 --> 05:29.050
I seem to have underestimated you.

05:29.820 --> 05:35.120
Never in my teaching career have I had 
a student so bad at controlling magic.

05:38.060 --> 05:40.520
GOT HELP

05:40.810 --> 05:43.790
Do I not have talent?

05:43.790 --> 05:44.440
Huh?

05:44.440 --> 05:45.790
You thought you did?

05:46.540 --> 05:47.820
Crap!

05:47.820 --> 05:52.000
Forget becoming a first-class magician. 
I might not even pass the exam!

05:52.000 --> 05:54.480
Sis, Mom's calling.

05:54.480 --> 05:56.420
The family finances are in trouble.

05:59.970 --> 06:02.080
Is your leg okay?

06:02.080 --> 06:04.530
I fell from a ladder and broke it.

06:04.530 --> 06:06.850
I can't harvest the fruit.

06:06.850 --> 06:09.480
Could you do it on your own for a while?

06:09.480 --> 06:11.590
I have to prepare for exams.

06:11.590 --> 06:13.060
In that case...

06:13.460 --> 06:15.970
Why not harvest them using magic?

06:15.970 --> 06:17.390
Two birds with one stone.

06:17.390 --> 06:19.170
There's no way, Master.

06:19.170 --> 06:20.250
"Master"?

06:20.250 --> 06:21.770
Just who are you talking to?

06:22.130 --> 06:24.630
How are you going to pay your 
entrance fees with no income?

06:24.630 --> 06:26.480
Well, true...

06:26.760 --> 06:28.410
Okay, how about this?

06:28.410 --> 06:33.220
For the half-year until the exam, you'll 
use your magic to do all the farm work.

06:33.220 --> 06:35.280
No other training besides that.

06:35.280 --> 06:37.580
Is that really going to help me pass?!

06:37.580 --> 06:38.570
That's up to you.

06:38.570 --> 06:41.320
I can't even control it.

06:41.320 --> 06:43.290
Yeah, yeah. Just try it.

06:43.290 --> 06:45.880
It's not my fault if anything goes wrong.

06:45.880 --> 06:48.270
Virgo Magic: Anima!

06:52.340 --> 06:54.530
What in the world?!

06:54.530 --> 06:59.630
That was too aggressive, but it 
went better than ever before.

07:00.280 --> 07:01.620
Why?

07:01.620 --> 07:05.890
Remember how I said that the more vividly 
you imagine it, the stronger the magic is?

07:05.890 --> 07:07.360
Right.

07:07.670 --> 07:10.180
I've been helping on the 
farm since I was little.

07:10.180 --> 07:13.330
Whether it's the height of the 
trees, how the branches grow,

07:13.330 --> 07:17.000
or how the fruit feels in my 
hand, I can imagine it perfectly.

07:17.000 --> 07:18.870
I think I can do this!

07:19.250 --> 07:22.220
I'll have the fruit that you ruin.

07:22.220 --> 07:24.640
I have a feeling this is 
what he's really after.

07:25.070 --> 07:28.980
And so, Spica's life as a farmer begins.

07:29.510 --> 07:36.720
DOCUMENTARY: MAGIC FARMING ON VIRGO FARM

07:29.510 --> 07:36.720
~ THE ROAD TO DELICIOUS FRUIT ~

07:30.290 --> 07:33.680
Documentary: Magic Farming on Virgo Farm:

07:33.680 --> 07:36.520
The Road to Delicious Fruit!

07:38.720 --> 07:40.180
WINTER - FEBRUARY: HARVESTING ORANGES

07:38.970 --> 07:42.040
Nose oranges are in season right now.

07:42.040 --> 07:45.550
There's a nose-like bump 
on the bottom part.

07:45.550 --> 07:49.380
It's a sweet, seedless variety 
that's very enjoyable.

07:52.270 --> 07:54.860
So hard to control...

07:55.740 --> 07:57.990
SPRING - APRIL: PRUNING

07:56.490 --> 07:58.320
Next, we have pruning.

07:58.320 --> 08:03.490
We trim extraneous branches to 
improve sun exposure and airflow.

08:03.490 --> 08:05.600
This season, instead of using scissors,

08:05.600 --> 08:08.390
I'll try adjusting the lengths 
of the branches with magic.

08:08.910 --> 08:13.180
Crimson oranges are delicious 
once it becomes warmer.

08:13.180 --> 08:17.830
There's a lot more we need to do 
in preparation for the harvest.

08:18.180 --> 08:19.600
INSECT CONTROL

08:18.370 --> 08:20.080
Dealing with insects...

08:21.510 --> 08:23.400
Eww! Gross!

08:23.390 --> 08:27.360
PEST BIRD CONTROL

08:23.400 --> 08:25.160
Dealing with birds...

08:27.610 --> 08:30.320
DEALING WITH WEATHER

08:27.860 --> 08:30.320
And dealing with weather!

08:30.730 --> 08:33.340
There's plenty more to do.

08:33.340 --> 08:35.780
I'm left exhausted every day.

08:36.020 --> 08:40.560
But the more effort we put in, 
the more delicious the oranges become.

08:40.560 --> 08:42.940
That makes it all worth it.

08:44.100 --> 08:46.280
And after a while of this...

08:46.280 --> 08:47.490
One more kilometer!

08:50.510 --> 08:51.990
Half a year later,

08:53.340 --> 08:55.220
on the day of the exam...

08:56.780 --> 08:59.240
Virgo Magic: Anima!

09:12.690 --> 09:13.890
I did it.

09:13.890 --> 09:15.230
You did.

09:15.230 --> 09:16.720
You did it.

09:17.110 --> 09:27.750
WE GREW THESE

09:18.120 --> 09:23.520
Super-sweet Virgo Farm 
orange harvest complete!

09:23.520 --> 09:25.890
Kitty loves them, too!

09:25.890 --> 09:27.750
Please give them a try.

09:27.750 --> 09:29.480
All done!

09:29.480 --> 09:30.800
Good work!

09:30.800 --> 09:34.330
You finished the entire harvest 
in half a day. I'm amazed.

09:34.330 --> 09:37.480
You're a professional farmer now.

09:38.460 --> 09:41.720
I'm going to grow the best 
oranges in the world!

09:41.720 --> 09:42.930
Wait, no!

09:42.930 --> 09:44.840
I'm trying to become a magician!

09:45.430 --> 09:48.540
I've been farming for the past six months.

09:48.540 --> 09:50.390
Am I really going to make it?

09:50.390 --> 09:53.330
I only know how to 
use one kind of magic...

09:54.200 --> 09:58.360
Master, is this really going to get me in?

09:58.630 --> 09:59.900
Dunno.

09:59.900 --> 10:02.560
The Diana entrance exams 
are different every time.

10:02.560 --> 10:04.940
Only one person in ten makes it in.

10:04.940 --> 10:06.870
It's a matter of luck.

10:13.240 --> 10:15.520
Nah, you don't stand a chance.

10:15.520 --> 10:18.020
What are you going to accomplish 
by making grass grow faster?

10:18.020 --> 10:19.770
Just give up and take over the farm.

10:19.770 --> 10:21.490
Shut up.

10:21.490 --> 10:23.110
The exam's all about luck.

10:23.110 --> 10:27.100
I guess it's a miracle that you 
learned to use magic at all.

10:27.330 --> 10:30.990
I'll laugh my ass off if 
I get in and you don't.

10:30.990 --> 10:32.930
I can't wait!

10:32.930 --> 10:34.870
I'm so worried...

10:34.870 --> 10:37.700
I don't know if I can do this on my own.

10:37.700 --> 10:40.900
Even my backpack feels heavier than usual.

10:41.280 --> 10:45.730
Diana applicants, 
please board the carriages.

10:48.030 --> 10:51.840
Wow, they take us to and 
from the exam venue.

10:51.840 --> 10:53.960
I'm getting nervous.

10:53.960 --> 10:55.060
Why?

10:55.060 --> 10:56.500
Well, I mean...

10:57.000 --> 11:00.020
Everyone here is a rival.

11:00.020 --> 11:01.880
A lot of them look tough, too.

11:01.880 --> 11:03.470
Not really.

11:03.470 --> 11:07.450
I think I'm number one, 
so none of that matters to me.

11:07.450 --> 11:09.720
I wish I had your mental fortitude.

11:09.720 --> 11:11.430
You should.

11:13.140 --> 11:15.310
It's pretty far.

11:15.310 --> 11:17.930
Where is the venue, anyway?

11:17.930 --> 11:21.060
Diana's in the capital, 
but we're out in the mountains.

11:21.060 --> 11:22.410
True...

11:30.740 --> 11:31.570
Falling rocks!

11:31.570 --> 11:32.550
Seriously?

11:32.550 --> 11:34.710
Are we going to make it in time?

11:50.870 --> 11:52.560
Wh-What is that?!

12:00.030 --> 12:02.790
Ow!

12:03.690 --> 12:06.390
What is that monster?!

12:07.850 --> 12:09.480
That would be a golem.

12:09.480 --> 12:11.750
Master?! You came with me?

12:13.260 --> 12:16.460
Golems are dolls of dirt 
controlled by magicians.

12:16.740 --> 12:19.040
Someone's manipulating 
it from the shadows.

12:19.040 --> 12:20.780
Is it the cultists again?!

12:20.780 --> 12:22.920
Seems they're after the students.

12:22.920 --> 12:25.140
Yo, baldy gorilla.

12:25.140 --> 12:27.440
We have an exam to get to.

12:27.440 --> 12:28.400
Aria?!

12:30.430 --> 12:32.640
Try to read the room!

12:33.370 --> 12:36.990
Aquarius Magic: Hydro Cannon!

12:41.580 --> 12:42.860
Wow.

12:42.860 --> 12:44.060
Oh?

12:44.060 --> 12:49.190
Aquarius can give form to water 
and channel its abilities.

12:49.760 --> 12:53.190
It takes immense magic 
power and knowledge.

12:53.190 --> 12:56.800
She's got excellent magic instincts.

12:56.800 --> 12:57.860
That said...

13:02.720 --> 13:04.170
So annoying...

13:04.170 --> 13:06.380
That thing's indestructible!

13:06.380 --> 13:07.800
It does have a weakness.

13:07.800 --> 13:09.630
You found out about it, too.

13:09.630 --> 13:10.700
At the library.

13:10.700 --> 13:12.260
The library...

13:14.730 --> 13:16.310
Right, golems!

13:16.840 --> 13:19.970
They're controlled by a magician's spell.

13:19.970 --> 13:23.140
They always have a core that 
functions as their heart.

13:23.140 --> 13:25.770
The core... The core...

13:26.030 --> 13:26.960
Look!

13:26.960 --> 13:28.740
The center part where 
the rocks are gathering!

13:28.740 --> 13:30.890
There's writing on the stone slab there.

13:30.890 --> 13:32.170
That might be the core!

13:32.640 --> 13:37.740
The magician imbues the golem with life 
by inscribing "emeth" on the core.

13:33.120 --> 13:38.960
TRUTH

13:37.740 --> 13:43.220
But by erasing the first letter so that 
it reads "meth," it returns to the earth.

13:38.960 --> 13:46.920
DEATH

13:43.220 --> 13:44.970
That's what the book said.

13:45.260 --> 13:46.830
I have to tell Aria!

13:46.830 --> 13:48.430
What are you, stupid?

13:48.710 --> 13:50.780
You're just going to dump it on her?

13:50.780 --> 13:52.850
What have you spent the 
past six months doing?

13:53.330 --> 13:55.120
You're defeating it.

13:56.650 --> 13:58.620
Th-There's no way!

13:58.620 --> 14:00.690
Your friend's out there fighting.

14:03.650 --> 14:06.770
Weren't you going to become 
a first-class magician?

14:07.920 --> 14:09.770
And what are you doing that for?

14:13.640 --> 14:14.780
Shit!

14:15.400 --> 14:17.620
Breath of life! Anima!

14:24.450 --> 14:26.580
Thank goodness I wasn't too late.

14:26.580 --> 14:27.860
Spica!

14:27.860 --> 14:30.300
Wait, was that Spica's magic?

14:33.040 --> 14:35.500
Master is right.

14:35.500 --> 14:39.100
I was scared of fighting.

14:40.140 --> 14:41.850
Sorry, Aria.

14:42.690 --> 14:46.160
I know its weakness.

14:46.160 --> 14:48.210
Is it okay if I join the fight?

14:48.210 --> 14:49.310
Huh?

14:49.310 --> 14:51.660
I mean, you're completely freaked out.

14:51.660 --> 14:52.970
Of course I'm scared!

14:52.970 --> 14:54.280
So why...

14:54.280 --> 14:57.480
I'm so scared, 
my heart's about to explode.

14:58.620 --> 15:02.990
But I want to become a magician who 
can protect the people around me!

15:07.510 --> 15:10.910
I'm okay with having you in the 
fight, but what's the plan?

15:11.450 --> 15:13.890
There's writing on the core in the middle.

15:13.890 --> 15:15.680
Erase the first letter, and it'll die.

15:15.680 --> 15:16.900
Say what?

15:16.900 --> 15:19.570
I'm going to destroy the core.

15:19.570 --> 15:22.440
Could you break it into smithereens again?

15:22.440 --> 15:24.520
Ah, I can't do that.

15:26.320 --> 15:29.540
I don't have the magic power 
left to launch anything big.

15:29.540 --> 15:31.120
What?!

15:32.940 --> 15:34.290
Eep!

15:34.290 --> 15:35.460
Aria, are you okay?

15:35.460 --> 15:37.830
Remember who you're worrying about.

15:45.500 --> 15:46.460
Crap!

15:50.220 --> 15:52.120
It's blocked our way out!

15:57.260 --> 15:58.810
Help me!

15:59.460 --> 16:00.380
Spica!

16:00.380 --> 16:01.610
I'll stop it!

16:05.430 --> 16:07.960
Virgo Magic: Anima!

16:12.060 --> 16:14.030
There, I've snared it.

16:15.000 --> 16:17.000
What... is this magic?

16:17.370 --> 16:19.920
I thought you were just 
farming this whole time.

16:19.920 --> 16:24.090
By working that huge orchard 
all on her own every day,

16:24.090 --> 16:26.770
she developed stamina 
and control over magic.

16:26.770 --> 16:30.670
And she focused on one kind of magic, so 
she was able to master it in a short time.

16:31.230 --> 16:33.760
You really are an idiot.

16:33.760 --> 16:36.120
You don't even know your own capabilities.

16:36.120 --> 16:37.170
Hey!

16:37.170 --> 16:39.260
Come after me instead!

16:39.730 --> 16:41.100
Spica...

16:41.100 --> 16:42.890
She's serious.

16:45.280 --> 16:47.430
I don't like it!

16:47.430 --> 16:51.150
Spica's supposed to be the derpy klutz 
who doesn't get rewarded for her efforts!

16:51.150 --> 16:52.850
That's what makes her cute!

16:55.600 --> 16:57.480
It fell apart and freed itself!

16:57.480 --> 16:59.330
And I'd just managed to catch it!

16:59.330 --> 17:00.280
Good.

17:00.600 --> 17:02.370
If it fell apart, then...

17:02.650 --> 17:04.360
There! The core!

17:04.870 --> 17:06.190
Anima!

17:08.160 --> 17:09.950
I don't have much magic left.

17:09.950 --> 17:11.860
I have to make it happen now!

17:18.210 --> 17:19.330
Anima!

17:20.370 --> 17:22.410
I'm too pinned down to retaliate!

17:22.410 --> 17:24.560
Should I hang on until it's out of rocks?

17:24.560 --> 17:26.230
But my Anima is going to run out!

17:27.030 --> 17:29.930
I'm done for if this goes on!

17:29.930 --> 17:32.970
Aquarius Magic: Aqua Sphere!

17:33.960 --> 17:37.470
Hey, now. You didn't forget 
about me, did you?

17:37.470 --> 17:38.670
Aria!

17:38.670 --> 17:42.410
Who said you could win 
this all on your own?

17:42.410 --> 17:45.530
I set the stage for you.

17:45.530 --> 17:47.040
You'd better win, or I'll be pissed.

17:47.040 --> 17:48.540
Thanks!

17:48.540 --> 17:51.490
I have to end it in the split second 
when the water barrier's down.

17:53.370 --> 17:57.410
I'll wind the vines together 
and pull them back like a whip...

17:57.410 --> 17:58.360
and slash it!

18:14.650 --> 18:16.580
I did it!

18:16.580 --> 18:19.290
When did you get so strong?

18:21.200 --> 18:24.200
It's thanks to your support.

18:24.200 --> 18:26.440
And I think I got lucky.

18:26.440 --> 18:29.520
You can't defeat a golem with luck alone.

18:34.020 --> 18:37.430
Examinee Number 201, Spica.

18:37.430 --> 18:38.950
Who's this old dude?!

18:38.950 --> 18:40.950
How do you know my name?

18:40.950 --> 18:43.030
You must be the one who 
was controlling the golem!

18:43.030 --> 18:45.140
Hey, it's the vice principal.

18:45.140 --> 18:47.550
Vice principal?

18:47.930 --> 18:50.090
Hello, everyone.

18:50.090 --> 18:54.070
I'm the vice principal of 
Diana Academy, Justice Libra.

18:54.070 --> 18:55.780
Pleased to make your acquaintance.

18:55.990 --> 18:58.250
We were attacked by a golem!

18:56.050 --> 18:57.310
Uh-oh...

18:57.310 --> 18:59.240
I called him an old dude.

18:57.580 --> 18:59.230
Will we make it in time for the exam?!

18:59.600 --> 19:02.700
That concludes the surprise exam.

19:02.700 --> 19:05.440
Please receive healing 
magic if you've been hurt.

19:05.440 --> 19:08.280
I did think something was off.

19:08.280 --> 19:12.440
Come on! I freaked out thinking 
it was the cultists or something.

19:13.670 --> 19:15.970
Bullshit! This is ridiculous!

19:15.970 --> 19:17.890
If we'd known, we would've fought, too!

19:18.550 --> 19:23.160
Magic can be good or evil 
depending on who wields it.

19:23.730 --> 19:29.590
At our academy, we value the qualities 
of those with healthy souls.

19:29.990 --> 19:35.090
I took the liberty of observing 
your aptitudes without notice.

19:35.090 --> 19:38.560
I needed to see how you 
would respond to threats.

19:38.970 --> 19:41.270
Would you flee for your lives?

19:41.270 --> 19:43.570
Could you make full use of your magic?

19:43.570 --> 19:45.800
Could you protect yourselves using magic?

19:45.800 --> 19:48.030
Could you help others?

19:48.030 --> 19:50.380
Could you confront the enemy?

19:51.730 --> 19:58.260
Aria Aquarius can be somewhat reckless, 
but she's quick to take initiative.

19:58.460 --> 20:00.860
She's perfectly magically capable.

20:01.410 --> 20:04.910
Spica Virgo lacks variety in her magic,

20:04.910 --> 20:07.630
but she has the courage to 
act for the sake of others.

20:08.640 --> 20:13.600
In recognition of their quick 
thinking in defeating the golem,

20:13.600 --> 20:16.990
these two are deemed to have passed 
the practical section of the exam.

20:18.180 --> 20:20.920
I... passed?

20:21.360 --> 20:23.840
Details will be provided later.

20:24.240 --> 20:28.060
If you weren't chosen today, I hope you 
can take this opportunity to improve.

20:29.970 --> 20:32.290
Let us meet next at Diana.

20:34.540 --> 20:35.970
I passed the exam.

20:35.970 --> 20:37.940
So why do I feel so unsatisfied?

20:37.940 --> 20:39.710
I gotta train harder.

20:39.990 --> 20:44.010
Master, I'm not dreaming, am I?

20:44.010 --> 20:45.470
Calm down.

20:45.470 --> 20:47.570
You just made it to the starting line.

20:47.970 --> 20:50.910
That's right. I forgot that 
this is the way he is.

20:50.910 --> 20:53.030
What a buzzkill.

20:53.030 --> 20:54.160
But, well...

20:54.990 --> 20:57.270
You stood firm and fought well.

20:59.410 --> 21:00.990
I'll give you that much.

21:02.590 --> 21:04.080
That was embarrassing...

21:04.080 --> 21:07.060
I just saw Master Claude 
in my mind for a second.

21:07.630 --> 21:10.730
There's seriously something wrong with me.

21:12.250 --> 21:18.490
I just got a tiny bit of praise from 
this unserious person... Well, this cat.

21:19.620 --> 21:22.720
How come it's making me so happy?

21:23.870 --> 21:29.950
But I never could have fought the golem 
if Master hadn't given me direction.

21:30.790 --> 21:35.060
Claude Sirius might really 
be an amazing person.

23:07.520 --> 23:09.400
Principal! This is important!

23:10.200 --> 23:12.140
Oh? What is it?

23:12.140 --> 23:15.420
A letter has arrived from Claude 
Sirius, who's been missing!

23:17.030 --> 23:18.700
Well, well.

23:19.940 --> 23:23.920
So my oaf of an apprentice is still alive.

23:26.270 --> 23:28.970
Celebrating admission to 
the Royal Diana Academy!

23:28.970 --> 23:29.800
Right...

23:29.800 --> 23:32.580
Professor Claude's out of magic, 
and I have to kiss his butt

23:32.580 --> 23:34.720
every day to make him human.

23:34.720 --> 23:35.340
Problem?

23:35.340 --> 23:36.890
Obviously!

23:36.890 --> 23:39.780
Next episode: "The Magicians of the Zodiac."

23:36.890 --> 23:40.420
EPISODE 3: THE MAGICIANS OF THE ZODIAC
